WEBVTT

00:00:29.233 --> 00:00:30.234
orcs

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:34.906
and small but heroic hobbits
fighting against impossible odds

00:00:34.906 --> 00:00:36.908
to defeat a powerful enemy.

00:00:37.658 --> 00:00:39.285
Kind of like life.

00:00:40.286 --> 00:00:41.788
But one thing bothered me.

00:00:43.081 --> 00:00:46.042
There weren’t enough
female characters in this book.

00:00:47.877 --> 00:00:51.547
The adventurers accompanying
the protagonists were all male.

00:00:53.549 --> 00:00:55.927
It made me feel left out,

00:00:55.927 --> 00:00:59.055
like I did in school when --

00:00:59.055 --> 00:01:00.932
you’re not going to believe this --